    "No Video recorded. Can be used for audio-only recording. Make sure Audio sources are enabled.": "不录制画面，可用于仅录制音频。\n请先启用需要录制的音频来源。",
    "Use FFmpeg for encoding. Requires ffmpeg.exe, if not found option for downloading or specifying path is shown.": "使用 FFmpeg 进行编码。\n需要 ffmpeg.exe；未找到时，可选择下载或指定其所在目录。",
    "Use internal Gif encoder. Variable Frame Rate mode is recommended.": "使用内置 GIF 编码器。\n建议启用可变帧率模式。",
